  "x11Unavailable": "This option requires a host DISPLAY for an X11 or XWayland session.",
  "x11WindowControlsConfirm": "Set GDK_BACKEND=x11 for this profile only? Use with GTK applications compatible with X11/XWayland; scaling or Wayland integration may differ. X11 provides weaker window isolation than Wayland. Buttons are not guaranteed for non-resizable dialogs or custom title bars. Other environment values, arguments and profile data remain unchanged. Save and restart the profile to apply. To undo, remove GDK_BACKEND from the environment or change it to wayland.",
